YANI: Light of E=E4rendil

An artifact amulet. Wishable, giftable, bonesable but only randomly
generated in the inventory of elvenkings.
Made of crystal so it can be shattered by force bolt, striking, kicking
etc. Elven characters who break the E=E4rendil take a wisdom hit.

When worn or wielded:
- Acts as a weak, permanent light source.
- When #invoked, causes fear and/or mild damage to any giant spiders
within its light radius.
- Perhaps elven characters (including NPCs) could get some improved
#invocation effect..?

NOTE: I know nethack elves =3D/=3D Tolkien elves but nethack hobbits have
nethack elvish cloaks and daggers,and you've got lembas in the game, so
Tolkien elf-lore DOES make a show in NH.
Also, I'm aware that in the books the E=E4rendil is not worn as an
amulet, but it seems unlikely anyone would bother to wield it, so by
taking up the amulet slot (and thus depriving the player of an "oLS or
"oR) this artifact has a downside as well as an upside.



